<title>Cabo Delgado, Mozambique: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mozambique/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mozambique-2026-11-12T03:57:42.316Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:57:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado beheaded six Christians and killed a Catholic priest after he baptized 175 people, showing continued targeting of religious figures. Mozambican police killed three robbers at a micro-credit service, indicating security actions beyond the insurgency. The United States warned of a growing ISIS threat to African maritime trade, while reported abuses are undermining Mozambican counter-insurgency efforts. Oil prices rebounded after Hormuz shipping attacks, affecting regional economic expectations. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5nUHJNZG5wNTNoTEJoeXYzWlhhNlIxcXFYclhQQVdKdkJ5d0ExWjBpR1NFRWpkSmQxeHd1dUNTYk1jaVpicXRFbi1za1p0WHhFWDJUNmlHbUlvM3NXTXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1SdVpvLTl3Qi01N0RVTWxpRXZJdkg4ODlRa2NIRmZDWXlreTYzc3Fac3NMWTh2NFlwMS1POVlaTVVlUWVxbF9tUmI1OGxEQWdsektXdE1UQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZ3FocE5HMjlSTi12VVYwNVphRFZSMHYweXlKSWZEb2huVnhSMVlyS1ctN0VteEJtQVo1dXI3SDI3NEowakdETlRMUjBDdHR6bjN5UDE4ODBKZTkzSHRyMnlaZ2tUZzFnSW9Xd2lnNS1BZUZqUS1UMldaNjA3UDQzdVFZdFlONG1zWTM4ZzhoczlmVHRSdFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sport News Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOQXBldm8xYlJBYXR5d0Z3cUVUR0E5SkIzNkJiVktwU3ZNXzBtUzFRNnAwa3hhcHBPVW85aFJXTmEtampMdjhWaDFxWmZ0VVdITjNQekp5V1hXblVEamFIaThCbTRqSXRJbE1YcUpTXzdMWVN0REhYREM3ZXBPNWJkZXlZNl9XRFplZ1lkajRQS1VreXhzNXl3YTFlOTk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://